__pycache__/
*.pyc

# DCS self-hosting: per-worktree and main-checkout-only state.
# A tracked ACTIVE would ride an incident's merge into main and wedge the
# gate for every future incident; a tracked esg/ would diverge across
# every branch instead of staying the single portfolio source of truth.
.dcs/ACTIVE
.dcs/CLOSED
.dcs/esg/

# Obsidian per-user UI state (the vault's notes ARE tracked; this is not).
# Leading-path patterns anchor to the repo root, so these need **/ to
# reach vault/.obsidian/ -- learned by watching workspace.json commit itself.
**/.obsidian/workspace*.json
**/.obsidian/cache
**/.obsidian/app.json
